---
// Vietnamese EPS quirk: Bonus & Welfare Fund (Quỹ khen thưởng, phúc lợi) reduces statutory EPS.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 275;
---
<figure class="sbp7-eps">
  <div class="sbp7-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Vietnamese VAS EPS calculation: from 500B Net Profit after Tax, subtracting 15% (75B) allocated to Bonus and Welfare Fund leaves 425B attributable to common shares, raising real P/E from 8.5x naive to 10.0x.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="sbp7-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Why Vietnamese EPS is smaller than Net Profit ÷ Shares: the Bonus &amp; Welfare Fund cut</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Vì sao EPS ở Việt Nam thấp hơn Lãi ròng ÷ Số CP: phần trích Quỹ khen thưởng, phúc lợi</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Box 1 */}
      <rect x="20" y="56" width="265" height="194" rx="10" class="sbp7-card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={48} y={84} size={22} />
      <text x="72" y="88" class="sbp7-hdr">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Headline Net Profit</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Lãi ròng trên KQKD</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="36" y="124" class="sbp7-body">• Profit: 500B VND</text>
      <text x="36" y="152" class="sbp7-body">• Shares: 100M shares</text>
      <text x="36" y="180" class="sbp7-body">• Stock price: 42,500 đ</text>
      <text x="36" y="216" class="sbp7-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Naive EPS = 5,000 đ (P/E 8.5x)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tính nhẩm: 5.000 đ (P/E 8,5x)</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Arrow 1 */}
      <line x1="292" y1="150" x2="314" y2="150" class="sbp7-line" />
      <polygon points="314,145 322,150 314,155" class="sbp7-arrow" />

      {/* Box 2 */}
      <rect x="326" y="56" width="248" height="194" rx="10" class="sbp7-card-red" />
      <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={354} y={84} size={22} />
      <text x="378" y="88" class="sbp7-hdr sbp7-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>VAS Circular 200 Cut</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Trừ Quỹ KTPL (VAS)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="342" y="124" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>AGM sets 15% Bonus &amp; Welfare</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>ĐHĐCĐ trích 15% Quỹ KTPL</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="342" y="154" class="sbp7-body sbp7-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>−75B goes to staff, NOT owners</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>−75 tỷ trả nhân sự, không chia CĐ</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="342" y="196" class="sbp7-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Owner earnings: 425B VND</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Lãi thuộc CĐ phổ thông: 425 tỷ</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Arrow 2 */}
      <line x1="581" y1="150" x2="603" y2="150" class="sbp7-line" />
      <polygon points="603,145 611,150 603,155" class="sbp7-arrow" />

      {/* Box 3 */}
      <rect x="615" y="56" width="265" height="194" rx="10" class="sbp7-card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="ok" x={643} y={84} size={22} />
      <text x="667" y="88" class="sbp7-hdr">
        <tspan data-lang-en>True Statutory EPS</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>EPS chuẩn trên BCTC</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="631" y="124" class="sbp7-body">• 425B ÷ 100M = 4,250 đ</text>
      <text x="631" y="152" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• True P/E: 42.5k ÷ 4.25k = 10.0x</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• P/E thật: 42,5k ÷ 4,25k = 10,0x</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="631" y="196" class="sbp7-sub sbp7-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>+18% pricier than naive P/E!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đắt hơn +18% so với tính nhẩm!</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Under Vietnamese Accounting Standards, profit allocated to the Bonus and Welfare Fund (Quỹ khen thưởng, phúc lợi) leaves shareholders' equity forever and must be deducted from EPS — some SOEs allocate 15%–25% every year.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Theo chuẩn mực kế toán Việt Nam, phần trích Quỹ khen thưởng – phúc lợi chi ra cho người lao động không thuộc về cổ đông nên bị trừ thẳng khi tính EPS — nhiều doanh nghiệp trích tới 15%–25% mỗi năm.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp7-eps { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp7-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp7-eps svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp7-eps text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp7-title { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp7-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .sbp7-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp7-hdr { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp7-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp7-body { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .sbp7-sub { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp7-line { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp7-arrow { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp7-eps figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
